librknnrt (2.3.2-1+rkr7.20250408.e50bab8) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Three binary packages: the runtime, its headers, and rknn-server, so that
    installing the runtime does not start a daemon.
  * The SONAME carries no version, so librknnrt.so ships in the runtime
    package rather than in librknnrt-dev.

